# init.recovery.vold_decrypt.rc - intentionally EMPTY placeholder.
#
# OrangeFox/TWRP init.rc UNCONDITIONALLY imports /init.recovery.vold_decrypt.rc
# even when TW_INCLUDE_CRYPTO := false (which is what stops the build from
# generating this file). A missing import target makes Android 9 init
# LOG(FATAL) and crash -> lk reloads recovery -> bootloop.
#
# This device has crypto/decryption disabled (ramdisk size limit), so there is
# nothing for this file to do; an empty file satisfies the import.
